00:29:59,070 --> 00:30:10,230
we do like hundreds more hours of simulation, CPU hours, and look much more deeply for bugs in any of those versions, then give you a report when you get in in the morning, and then you can sort of pick up where you left off.

313
00:30:10,230 --> 00:30:12,430
I think that would be really cool, and and that's sort of what we're aiming to get towards.

